002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F08%2F18%2FS__13606948.jpg?alt=media&token=3f45c4e0-c4a9-4e2b-8e23-734168746747",[45,82,83,84],{"style":47},"2. 下載完成後，將 ShopBack 釘起來",[14,85],{"src":86,"alt":87},"https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F08%2F18%2FS__13606947.jpg?alt=media&token=cec4b093-194c-4aa1-b841-0762bcbafeb1","✨ 重點筆記（2）",[45,89,90],{"style":47},"3. 基本上就完成安裝 ShopBack 擴充工具囉！",[45,92,93,94,97,98],{"style":47},"4. 最令人期待的時刻來臨了，一定要把握時間拿下優惠 😆 ",[95,96],"br",{},"搜尋「六角學院」",[14,99],{"src":100,"alt":101},"https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F08%2F18%2FS__13606946.jpg?alt=media&token=859361b1-d3ca-4a36-af8d-8122185e5355","✨ 重點筆記（3）",[45,103,104,105],{"style":47},"5. 請確認畫面是否有出現「現金回饋已啟動」",[14,106],{"src":107,"alt":108},"https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F08%2F18%2FS__13606945.jpg?alt=media&token=1ed73742-e3c2-4b65-9cc5-de03d5662707","✨ 重點筆記（4）",[45,110,111,112,114,115,118,119],{"style":47},"6. 太讚了！省錢小達人 94 你，接下來你可以自由選擇你所需的課程！",[95,113],{},"提醒同學，請務必記得使用",[22,116,117],{},"信用卡付款","唷",[14,120],{"src":121,"alt":122},"https:\u002F\u002Ffirebasestorage.googleapis.com\u002Fv0\u002Fb\u002Fhexschool-api.appspot.com\u002Fo\u002Fblog%2F2022%2F08%2F18%2FS__13606949.jpg?alt=media&token=7a928256-424e-40d9-a716-6a098a8c0e74","✨ 重點筆記（5）",[36,124,125],{"id":125},"注意事項",[11,127,128],{},[22,129,130],{},"1. 怎樣才能獲得 ShopBack 現金回饋呢？",[41,132,43,133],{},[45,134,135],{"style":47},"需透過 ShopBack 前往六角學院官網購物，且在 1 小時內於同一瀏覽器中完成結帳，才可享有 ShopBack 現金回饋資格，若符合 ShopBack 現金回饋資格，回饋金將於確定付款完成後由 ShopBack 發送。",[11,137,138],{},[22,139,140],{},"2. 為什麼我沒有獲得 ShopBack 現金回饋？",[41,142,43,143,43,146,43,149],{},[45,144,145],{"style":47},"如果取消課程訂單、退刷退款、從 ShopBack 連結至六角官網未立刻下單且沒有在當次完成購買課程或結帳過程中曾經關閉瀏覽器，將有可能導致無法獲得現金回饋。",[45,147,148],{"style":47},"您使用的瀏覽器有設定阻擋追蹤或安裝阻擋廣告程式，例如：取消 cookie 追蹤或 JavaScript 功能，或啟動 Adblock 等。",[45,150,151,152,156],{"style":47},"現金回饋之最終審核與發放以登入 ShopBack 後顯示為準，若有回饋上不符之問題請直接與 ShopBack 客服聯繫；若遺失回饋金，請於消費後的 30 日內向 ShopBack 客服人員申請，本院僅為 ShopBack 合作商家，相關回饋金問題可至 ",[30,153,155],{"href":154,"target":33},"https:\u002F\u002Fsupport.shopback.com.tw\u002Fhc\u002Fzh-tw","ShopBack 官網常見問答","了解更多。",{"title":158,"searchDepth":159,"depth":159,"links":160},"",2,[161,162],{"id":38,"depth":159,"text":39},{"id":125,"depth":159,"text":125},null,"2022-08-29","六角學院首次與 ShopBack 合作加碼大優惠，除了全館課程 75 折，更另外再加碼 6% 現金回饋，要趁著開學季回饋給同學們（大期待～太幸福了😍",false,"md",{},true,"\u002Fblog\u002F2022\u002F2022-08-29-hexschool-shopback",{"title":5,"description":165},"blog\u002F2022\u002F2022-08-29-hexschool-shopBack",[174],"event","vTj6CtSkmUfmpC2YMX_TmewMDCUWQtD4x97MgRCDmxA",{"prev":177,"next":180,"related":183,"tags":194},{"title":178,"link":179},"邀請：【企業交流】前端學員成果發表會","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-09-02-invite-enterprise-to-students-result-presentation",{"title":181,"link":182},"【轉職前端工程師】我跟你一樣零基礎，不要怕，你也可以成功！","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-08-15-learn-from-zero",[184,187,190,191],{"title":185,"link":186},"7 週年感謝祭優惠活動","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-12-16-7th-anniversary-thanks",{"title":188,"link":189},"The F2E 4th 前端 & UI 修煉精神時光屋","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-09-09-the-f2e-4th-2022",{"title":178,"link":179},{"title":192,"link":193},"2022 鐵人賽","\u002Fblog\u002F2022-08-08-ithome-2022ironman",[195,196,197,198,199,174,200,201,202,203,204],"UI design","course","css","css3","enterprise","interview","javascript","jobs","skilltree","software engineer",1790064291464]